#tr.en: under the control of Utul-ištar the scribe,
4. sza ib-ni-{d}utu _dumu_ a-wi-li-ia 
#tr.ts: ša ibni-šamaš mār awīlīya
#tr.en: that Ibni-šamaš son of Awīlīya
5. im-hu-ru 
#tr.ts: imḫuru
#tr.en: received,
